1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:10,188
Deutsche Welle reports that drug-related deaths in Germany remain near record levels, with a worrying rise among people under 30.

2
00:00:10,138 --> 00:00:14,902
Officials link many cases to new and stronger substances.

3
00:00:14,902 --> 00:00:20,564
The problem is becoming a broader social issue, not only a policing issue.

4
00:00:20,564 --> 00:00:28,358
Health services, prevention programs, and faster warnings about dangerous drugs may all become more urgent.

